//@version=6
// NR (NON-REPAINTING) BUILD, 2026-10-02. Every request.security() call now returns the LAST COMPLETED
// higher-timeframe bar (expression[1] with lookahead_on), so live bars, history and alerts see the same
// values. Before, live bars read the still-forming 10s / 30s / 3m / 5m / HTF bar while history read
// completed bars: live trades could appear that the backtest never shows (seen 2026-10-02 16:18).
// Effect: 10s/30s/5m values arrive one 5-second chart bar later than in the old BACKTEST.
// The "Robust latch" input no longer changes anything (the latch is always on the HTF bar change).
// XAU FABLE X3 5s  -  XAU FABLE X3 1s (v7) for a 5-SECOND chart + a RUNNER (partial take-profit) exit.
// Why 5s and 1s give the same result: every signal comes from 10s / 30s / 3m / 5m data (request.security);
// the chart timeframe only sets when orders are filled. The 5s chart's advantage is DEPTH: TradingView keeps
// 5s FXCM history back to late March 2026, so the Apr-Jun months the X3 settings were NOT tuned on can be tested.
// THE RUNNER (group "X3 5s Runner"): when the G4 target is reached, (100 - runPct)% of the position is taken there;
//   the rest keeps running with its stop moved to entry + 0.5 pt and a 5 x ATR(30s) trailing stop (it also exits on
//   an opposite 30s cross). From the bar after the target fill the locked stop means a runner cannot turn the trade idea
//   into a loss, so the FundingPips 1% idea rule is unchanged (hard stop 0.9% on the full 28 oz until the target is hit).
//   v4/v9 review fixes: target leg never carries a stop above/below the market; the runner starts only after a real
//   profit-taking leg (any other size cut closes the rest); no runner when the target is within 0.5 pt + slippage of
//   entry; the $15 re-entry lockout is scaled to the size of each closed leg.
// TradingView deep backtests, FX:XAUUSD 5s, High detalization, $25k, profile A (28 oz, 0.9% stop), slippage 15 ticks:
//                        Apr 1 - Jul 1 (not tuned on)   Jul 1 - Sep 27 (X3 tuning period)   total
//   runner off (= X3 1s)          -505                         +9,040                      +8,535
//   runner 50%                   +1,062                        +10,903                     +11,965
//   runner 70% (default)         +1,794                        +11,576                     +13,370
//   runner 90%                   +2,405                        +12,332                     +14,737
//   Runner trail 5 x ATR tested best (3 x: -2,000 in Jul-Sep; 8 x: -1,600 in Apr-Jun). Max drawdown ~$1,800 in Apr-Jun
//   (unchanged by the runner) - still close to the $2,500 max-loss limit if a period like April repeats.
// Also tested on 5s and NOT made default: 5s-system gate (mode "gated by 5s"): -947 in Apr-Jun; 10s gate: -595 total;
//   impulse guard (I max impulse 10 / 120): helps Apr-Jun without a runner, but cuts the runner's best trades.
// RISK PROFILE (default A = funded account, Monthly payout, 1% idea cap): A = 28 oz/0.9% (Monthly payout, 1% idea cap) | B = 42 oz/1.35% + 2.5% day guard
//   | C = B + x1.34 after a loss | D = 56 oz/1.8% + guard. TradingView 1s "Last 30 days" (to Sep 25 2026):
//   A +4,384 / B +6,333 / C +6,818 / D +8,444 (87.5-87.8% win). Grid tested and rejected (+6,464, 2x the drawdown of D).
// Profile A = the tested FundingPips build "F1": 28 oz, 0.9% hard stop (8.04 pt), 60 s min hold,
//   G4 target as limit order, robust 1s latch, 10-min same-direction lockout after ANY loss.
//   TradingView deep backtest, FX:XAUUSD 1s, Jun 28 - Sep 25 2026: 155 trades, +$8,576, 80.0% win.
// Setting qty 30, slPct 0.95, lockFrac 0.9, min hold 0, G4 limit off, robust latch off reproduces
//   X2 v8 (verified trade-for-trade on TradingView: 70 trades / +$5,254.20 on Aug 20 - Sep 25).
// X3 adds (all optional, see the "X3" input groups):
//   * min-hold before discretionary exits (FundingPips bans HFT / tick scalping) - stops stay live
//   * G4 target as a resting limit order, G4 target multiplier, break-even after N seconds
//   * robust 30s/5m latch for 1s charts (a 1s bar exactly at the 30s close is often missing on 1s data)
//   * entry sessions, US-data news block, FundingPips-day loss guard / profit lock / max trades per day
//   * equity-based sizing, capped martingale, and a capped grid basket (one combined hard stop < 1%)
// Original notes follow.
// XAU CONSOLIDATED F.  FX:XAUUSD.  RUN THIS ON A 5-SECOND CHART.
// = Consolidated E + a hard stop expressed as a % of capital + a DISCIPLINED re-entry rule.
// After a stop-out the 30s signal is usually still live, so re-entry must be EARNED by
// something new (the fast gate breaking and re-arming, or price regaining the entry),
// never granted automatically and never repeated without limit.
//
// THE RULE (from the three-chart study, Aug 17 - Sep 16 2026 exports):
//   The 30-SECOND system (V14 MAX NET, cap 30) is the trade authority: its own
//   entries (score cross), its own trail / protective stop / hard cap.
//   A 30s ENTRY is taken ONLY if the 10-second AND the 5-second systems are
//   already positioned in the same direction at that moment. If not, the entry
//   is skipped (a flip still closes the old position). Exits are untouched.
//   Export simulation: 30s alone 50.5% / 82.1% win / 27 losers / DD 9.7%
//                      gated     52.5% / 91.7% win /  7 losers / DD 2.4%
//
// HOW IT WORKS
//   30s engines and their 5-minute persistent layer come through request.security
//   (lookahead OFF). Signals and stop levels are LATCHED at each closed 30-second
//   bar (the 5s bar whose close equals the 30s bar close), so nothing inside a
//   30s bar is seen early. The 10s system runs on 10S bars through security, the
//   5s system natively; both keep their own simulated stops so their direction
//   state is always current. No date gate. Runs live as written.
strategy("XAU X3 5s MART LAB NR", overlay = true, initial_capital = 25000,
     default_qty_type = strategy.fixed, default_qty_value = 20,
     commission_value = 0, slippage = 15, pyramiding = 0,
     margin_long = 0, margin_short = 0,
     calc_on_every_tick = false, process_orders_on_close = false,
     fill_orders_on_standard_ohlc = true, max_bars_back = 5000)

G0 = "Rule"
M_30  = "30s ONLY      (V14 MAX NET, cap 30 - validation baseline)"
M_G2  = "30s gated by 10s AND 5s   (the rule)"
M_G10 = "30s gated by 10s only"
M_G5  = "30s gated by 5s only"
M_G1  = "30s gated by 10s OR 5s"
pxScale = input.float(1.0, "Point scale for price-denominated inputs (1 = XAUUSD; about 0.012 for XAGUSD)", minval = 0.0001, step = 0.001, group = G0)
mode  = input.string(M_30, "MODE", options = [M_G2, M_30, M_G10, M_G5, M_G1], group = G0)
qtyIn = input.int(28, "Contracts (20 = 0.2 lot) - used by the Custom risk profile", minval = 1, group = G0)
cap30In = input.float(20.0, "30s hard cap, points (0 = off)", minval = 0.0, step = 1.0, group = G0)
cap30 = cap30In * pxScale
bePtsIn = input.float(0.0, "Break-even: after this many points in profit the stop can never be worse than entry (0 = off)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.5, group = G0)
bePts = bePtsIn * pxScale
lockPIn = input.float(0.0, "Lock-in: after break-even arms, keep the stop this many points INTO profit (0 = at entry)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.5, group = G0)
lockP = lockPIn * pxScale
pcMin = input.int(0, "Progress check: minutes after entry (0 = off)", minval = 0, group = G0)
pcPtsIn = input.float(2.0, "Progress check: close if best favourable move is still below this many points", minval = 0.0, step = 0.5, group = G0)
pcPts = pcPtsIn * pxScale
G1 = "Risk and re-entry"
slPctIn = input.float(0.9, "Hard stop, % of initial capital (Custom profile) (0 = off, use the points cap only)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.1, group = G1)
R_BOTH = "GATE + RECLAIM   gate must re-arm AND price regain the entry"
R_OFF  = "OFF              one entry per signal episode, never re-enter"
R_FRSH = "FRESH CROSS      re-enter on a new 30s cross (E behaviour)"
R_GATE = "GATE RE-ARM      10s+5s must break alignment then re-align"
R_PRC  = "PRICE RECLAIM    price must regain the episode entry price"
reMode = input.string(R_FRSH, "Re-entry after an exit while the signal is still live", options = [R_BOTH, R_OFF, R_FRSH, R_GATE, R_PRC], group = G1)
reMax  = input.int(0, "Max re-entries per episode (0 = unlimited)", minval = 0, group = G1)
// Funding Pips rule: after an exit taken to respect the 1 % per-trade floating drawdown limit,
// the same trade may not be re-entered for this many minutes. This is a firm rule, not a filter.
lockMin  = input.int(10, "Lockout after a hard-stop exit, minutes (firm rule)", minval = 0, group = G1)
lockBoth = input.bool(false, "Lockout blocks BOTH directions (off = same direction only)", group = G1)
lockFrac = input.float(0.05, "An exit counts as a hard stop when its loss is at least this fraction of the stop", minval = 0.01, maxval = 1.0, step = 0.05, group = G1)
G3 = "X3  1s + FundingPips"
minHoldS  = input.int(60, "Min hold before discretionary exits, seconds (HFT safety, 0 = off)", minval = 0, group = G3)
g4Limit   = input.bool(true, "G4 target as a resting limit order (no slippage)", group = G3)
g4TgtMult = input.float(1.0, "G4 target multiplier", minval = 0.1, step = 0.05, group = G3)
beAfterS  = input.int(0, "Break-even arms only after this many seconds in the trade (0 = immediately)", minval = 0, group = G3)
robLatch  = input.bool(true, "Robust 30s/5m latch (latch on the HTF bar change; recommended on 1s)", group = G3)
useSess1  = input.bool(false, "New entries only in window 1", inline = "s1", group = G3)
sess1     = input.session("0600-2100", "", inline = "s1", group = G3)
useSess2  = input.bool(false, "or in window 2", inline = "s2", group = G3)
sess2     = input.session("0000-0000", "", inline = "s2", group = G3)
sessTz    = input.string("UTC", "Entry window timezone", group = G3)
newsBlock = input.bool(false, "Block new entries 08:25-08:40, 09:55-10:10, 13:55-14:10 New York (Mon-Fri)", group = G3)
dayLossIn = input.float(0.0, "Daily loss guard, % (Custom profile) (FundingPips day 00:00 UTC+3, incl. floating; 0 = off)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.1, group = G3)
dayProfPct = input.float(0.0, "Daily profit lock, % (0 = off)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.1, group = G3)
maxTrDay  = input.int(0, "Max new trades per day (0 = unlimited)", minval = 0, group = G3)
riskPct   = input.float(0.0, "Size by risk: % of current equity per trade (0 = fixed contracts)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = G3)
martMultIn = input.float(1.0, "Martingale (Custom profile): size x this after each consecutive loss (1 = off)", minval = 1.0, step = 0.1, group = G3)
martMaxKIn = input.int(0, "Martingale (Custom profile): max steps", minval = 0, group = G3)
G5 = "X3  Grid basket"
gridN     = input.int(0, "Grid legs added on adverse moves (0 = off)", minval = 0, maxval = 5, group = G5)
gridStepIn  = input.float(4.0, "Grid spacing, points", minval = 0.1, step = 0.5, group = G5)
gridStep = gridStepIn * pxScale
gridMult  = input.float(1.0, "Grid leg size multiplier", minval = 1.0, step = 0.1, group = G5)
gridCapPct = input.float(0.9, "Basket hard stop, % of initial capital (combined loss)", minval = 0.1, step = 0.05, group = G5)
gridTpIn    = input.float(0.0, "Basket take-profit beyond average price, points (0 = keep G4 exit)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.25, group = G5)
gridTp = gridTpIn * pxScale
G6 = "X3  Extra management"
maxHoldMin = input.int(0, "Max holding time, minutes (0 = off)", minval = 0, group = G6)
newsFlat   = input.bool(false, "Flat + no new entries around US data times (08:30 / 10:00 / 14:00 New York, Mon-Fri)", group = G6)
newsPre    = input.int(6, "News window: minutes before", minval = 0, group = G6)
newsPost   = input.int(6, "News window: minutes after", minval = 0, group = G6)
friFlat    = input.bool(true, "Flat before the weekend (Fri 16:45 New York) and no entries after Fri 16:00", group = G6)
maxLossDay = input.int(0, "Stop for the day after N losing trades (0 = off)", minval = 0, group = G6)
quietPtsIn = input.float(0.0, "Quiet-tape block: no new entries while the last 15 closed 1-min bars span less than this many points (0 = off; in-sample only - failed the May 2026 out-of-sample test)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.25, group = G6)
breakFlat  = input.bool(false, "Mon-Thu: no entries from 16:45 NY, flat at 16:55 NY (before the daily 17:00 break)", group = G6)
reopenMin  = input.int(5, "No new entries for N minutes after the 18:00 NY reopen (0 = off)", minval = 0, group = G6)
reopenSun  = input.bool(true, "Reopen guard only at the Sunday weekly open (wide reopen spreads)", group = G6)
G7 = "X3 5s  Runner (partial take-profit at the G4 target) + trend filter"
runPct    = input.int(70, "Runner: % of the position kept past the G4 target (0 = off = X3 1s behaviour)", minval = 0, maxval = 90, step = 5, group = G7)
runNeed   = input.string("30s trend", "Keep a runner only when", options = ["Always", "30s trend", "30s + 10s + 5s"], group = G7,
     tooltip = "30s trend (default, tested): the 30s V14 score must still be on the trade's side when the target is hit. '30s + 10s + 5s' also needs the fast systems; on a 1s chart the '5s' system runs on 1-second bars, so that option behaves differently on 1s and 5s charts.")
runLockIn = input.float(0.5, "Runner stop, points beyond entry (set once the target part is taken)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.25, group = G7)
runTgtX   = input.float(0.0, "Runner target, x the G4 target distance from entry (0 = none: trail / 30s flip / time only)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.5, group = G7)
runMaxMin = input.int(0, "Runner max time after the partial, minutes (0 = off)", minval = 0, group = G7)
runTrlX   = input.float(5.0, "Runner trailing stop, x 30s ATR behind the best price (0 = keep the normal 30s trail)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.5, group = G7)
p5Must    = input.bool(false, "Entries need the 5-minute persistent trend to AGREE (off = only not opposed)", group = G7)
lockUsd    = input.float(15.0, "Lockout also after closes below this TradingView profit, USD (commission + live spread; FundingPips 10-min idea rule)", minval = 0.0, group = G6)
G4R = "X3  Risk profile (FundingPips 2-Step Standard $25k)"
RP_A = "A  Monthly payout cycle (1% idea cap): 28 oz, 0.9% stop"
RP_B = "B  Bi-Weekly / On-Demand payout: 42 oz, 1.35%, day guard 2.5%"
RP_C = "C  = B + x1.34 size on the trade after a loss"
RP_D = "D  Aggressive: 56 oz, 1.8%, day guard 2.5%"
RP_X = "Custom (use the inputs above/below)"
riskProfile = input.string(RP_A, "Risk profile", options = [RP_A, RP_B, RP_C, RP_D, RP_X], group = G4R,
     tooltip = "All profiles keep the same 8.04-point hard stop; only the size changes. The 1% per-trade-idea Striking System applies on a $25k Master only while the reward cycle is Monthly -> use A there. B/C/D are for the evaluation phases and Bi-Weekly / On-Demand Master accounts (limits: 5% daily, 10% max loss).")
qty        = riskProfile == RP_A ? 28 : riskProfile == RP_B or riskProfile == RP_C ? 42 : riskProfile == RP_D ? 56 : qtyIn
slPct      = riskProfile == RP_A ? 0.9 : riskProfile == RP_B or riskProfile == RP_C ? 1.35 : riskProfile == RP_D ? 1.8 : slPctIn
dayLossPct = riskProfile == RP_X ? dayLossIn : riskProfile == RP_A ? 0.0 : 2.5
martMult   = riskProfile == RP_C ? 1.34 : riskProfile == RP_X ? martMultIn : 1.0
martMaxK   = riskProfile == RP_C ? 1 : riskProfile == RP_X ? martMaxKIn : 0
// fast-system constants (Consolidated C frozen values; no overrides in this script)
mustAgree = false
capOv = 0.0
thrOv = 0.0
xnOv  = 0.0
reArm = false
xitVote = 0.0
pad10E = 5.5

// ============================ PRIMITIVES ============================
mEma(src, len) =>
    a = 2.0 / (math.max(1.0, len) + 1.0)
    var float e = na
    e := na(e) ? src : e + a * (src - e)
    e

mRma(src, len) =>
    a = 1.0 / math.max(1.0, len)
    var float r = na
    r := na(r) ? src : r + a * (src - r)
    r

mAtr(len) => mRma(ta.tr(true), len)

mDmi(len) =>
    up  = ta.change(high)
    dn  = -ta.change(low)
    pDM = na(up) or na(dn) ? 0.0 : (up > dn and up > 0 ? up : 0.0)
    mDM = na(up) or na(dn) ? 0.0 : (dn > up and dn > 0 ? dn : 0.0)
    tr  = mRma(ta.tr(true), len)
    pdi = tr == 0 ? 0.0 : 100.0 * mRma(pDM, len) / tr
    mdi = tr == 0 ? 0.0 : 100.0 * mRma(mDM, len) / tr
    pdi > mdi ? 1 : 0

// ============================ ENGINES ============================
ehma(s, n) => mEma(2 * mEma(s, int(n / 2)) - mEma(s, n), int(math.round(math.sqrt(n))))

fHull(n, slp) =>
    h = ehma(close, n)
    h > h[slp] ? 1 : 0

fSqz(n) =>
    v = ta.linreg(close - math.avg(math.avg(ta.highest(high, n), ta.lowest(low, n)), ta.sma(close, n)), n, 0)
    v > 0 ? 1 : 0

fUT(aL, key) =>
    a  = mAtr(aL)
    var float st = na
    p  = nz(st[1], close)
    nl = key * a
    st := close > p and close[1] > p ? math.max(p, close - nl) : close < p and close[1] < p ? math.min(p, close + nl) : close > p ? close - nl : close + nl
    close > st ? 1 : 0

fRF(per, mult) =>
    dab = math.abs(close - close[1])
    rng = mEma(mEma(dab, per), per * 2 - 1) * mult
    var float fl = na
    pf  = nz(fl[1], close)
    fl := close > pf ? (close - rng < pf ? pf : close - rng) : (close + rng > pf ? pf : close + rng)
    fl > pf ? 1 : fl < pf ? 0 : (close > fl ? 1 : 0)

fChand(aL, mult) =>
    a = mult * mAtr(aL)
    var float ls = na
    var float ss = na
    var int   dr = 1
    lb = ta.highest(close, aL) - a
    sb = ta.lowest(close, aL) + a
    pl = nz(ls[1], lb)
    ps = nz(ss[1], sb)
    ls := close[1] > pl ? math.max(lb, pl) : lb
    ss := close[1] < ps ? math.min(sb, ps) : sb
    dr := close > ps ? 1 : close < pl ? -1 : nz(dr[1], 1)
    [dr == 1 ? 1 : 0, ls, ss]

// vote bundle for one system on the timeframe it is evaluated on
f_vote(al, asl, bl, ca, ck, dp, dm, el, em, hl, xl, xa, atl) =>
    a = fHull(al, asl)
    b = fSqz(bl)
    c = fUT(ca, ck)
    d = fRF(dp, dm)
    [e, ls, ss] = fChand(el, em)
    f = mDmi(hl)
    sc  = a + b + c + 3 * d + e + f
    str = (close - mEma(close, xl)) / mAtr(xa)
    [sc, ls, ss, str, mAtr(atl), high, low, close, time]

// persistent trend vote (evaluated on the persistent timeframe)
f_pers(al, asl, bl, ca, ck, dp, dm, el, em, hl) =>
    a = fHull(al, asl)
    b = fSqz(bl)
    c = fUT(ca, ck)
    d = fRF(dp, dm)
    [e, l, s] = fChand(el, em)
    f = mDmi(hl)
    a + b + c + 3 * d + e + f

// ============================ FROZEN PARAMETER SETS ============================
// --- 10-SECOND system (V5-FROZEN values, verified +76.48% with 0.30 pt cost) ---
A10 = 1800,  AS10 = 120,  B10 = 1050, C10 = 120,  CK10 = 20.8
D10 = 230,   DM10 = 110.0, E10 = 12,  EM10 = 31.9, F10 = 150
XL10 = 1800, XA10 = 200,  AT10 = 50
ACT10 = 12.0, TRL10 = 2.65, PAD10 = 5.5, CAP10 = 30.0, XN10 = 10.0
QA10 = 600, QAS10 = 40, QB10 = 350, QC10 = 40, QCK10 = 12.0
QD10 = 77,  QDM10 = 63.5, QE10 = 4, QEM10 = 18.4, QF10 = 50

// --- 5-SECOND system (V2-NATIVE, hz 1.72 / vs 1.53, verified +72.80% on its own chart) ---
A1 = 3715, AS1 = 248, B1 = 2167, C1 = 248, CK1 = 31.824
D1 = 475,  DM1 = 168.3, E1 = 24, EM1 = 48.807, F1 = 310
XL1 = 3715, XA1 = 400, AT1 = 100
ACT1 = 10.71, TRL1 = 3.978, PAD1 = 12.24, CAP1 = 30.0, XN1 = 10.0
QA1 = 619, QAS1 = 41, QB1 = 361, QC1 = 41, QCK1 = 12.0016
QD1 = 79,  QDM1 = 63.47, QE1 = 4, QEM1 = 18.4063, QF1 = 52

THR = 7.0
TOT = 8.0
THRE   = thrOv > 0.0 ? thrOv : THR
xn1E   = xnOv  > 0.0 ? xnOv  : XN1
xn10E  = xnOv  > 0.0 ? xnOv  : XN10
cap1E  = capOv > 0.0 ? capOv : CAP1
cap10E = capOv > 0.0 ? capOv : CAP10

// ============================ DATA FEEDS ============================
// 1-second system, native on this chart
[s1, ls1, ss1, st1, atr1, h1, l1, c1, t1] = f_vote(A1, AS1, B1, C1, CK1, D1, DM1, E1, EM1, F1, XL1, XA1, AT1)

// 10-second system, on 10S bars, non-repainting
f_vote10p() =>
    [a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h, i] = f_vote(A10, AS10, B10, C10, CK10, D10, DM10, E10, EM10, F10, XL10, XA10, AT10)
    [a[1], b[1], c[1], d[1], e[1], f[1], g[1], h[1], i[1]]
[s10, ls10, ss10, st10, atr10, h10, l10, c10, t10] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", f_vote10p(), gaps = barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)

// persistent 3-minute vetoes, one per system, top level (no nesting)
p1raw  = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "3", f_pers(QA1, QAS1, QB1, QC1, QCK1, QD1, QDM1, QE1, QEM1, QF1)[1], gaps = barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
p10raw = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "3", f_pers(QA10, QAS10, QB10, QC10, QCK10, QD10, QDM10, QE10, QEM10, QF10)[1], gaps = barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)

pDir1  = p1raw  >= THR ? 1 : p1raw  <= TOT - THR ? -1 : 0
pDir10 = p10raw >= THR ? 1 : p10raw <= TOT - THR ? -1 : 0
var int pT1  = 0
var int pT10 = 0
if not na(pDir1)
    pT1 := pDir1
if not na(pDir10)
    pT10 := pDir10

// ============================ EXIT AUTHORITY ============================
// The system that owns the exit submits REAL orders (native protective stop +
// native trailing stop). Its hand-rolled level test is used only while we are flat,
// so its direction state keeps advancing even on signals we did not trade.
tk        = syminfo.mintick
authIsOne = false
simX1     = true
simX10    = true

// ============================ 1-SECOND STATE MACHINE (native) ============================
var int   q1   = 0
var float ep1  = na
var float hw1  = na
var bool  arm1 = false
var float lvl1 = na

up1 = s1 >= THRE         and s1[1] <  THRE
dn1 = s1 <= (TOT - THRE) and s1[1] >  (TOT - THRE)
al1 = mustAgree ? pT1 ==  1 : pT1 != -1
as1 = mustAgree ? pT1 == -1 : pT1 !=  1
xl1 = st1 <  xn1E
xs1 = st1 > -xn1E

// 1) last bar's protective level against this bar's range
if q1 != 0 and not na(lvl1) and simX1
    if (q1 > 0 and low <= lvl1) or (q1 < 0 and high >= lvl1)
        q1   := 0
        arm1 := false
        lvl1 := na

// 2) arm / high-water from this bar, then publish the level for the next bar
if q1 != 0 and not na(ep1)
    if not arm1
        if q1 > 0 and high >= ep1 + ACT1 * atr1
            arm1 := true
            hw1  := high
        if q1 < 0 and low <= ep1 - ACT1 * atr1
            arm1 := true
            hw1  := low
    if arm1
        hw1 := q1 > 0 ? math.max(hw1, high) : math.min(hw1, low)
    stopRaw1 = q1 > 0 ? ls1 - PAD1 * atr1 : ss1 + PAD1 * atr1
    capLvl1  = q1 > 0 ? ep1 - cap1E : ep1 + cap1E
    base1    = q1 > 0 ? math.max(stopRaw1, capLvl1) : math.min(stopRaw1, capLvl1)
    trl1     = arm1 ? (q1 > 0 ? hw1 - TRL1 * atr1 : hw1 + TRL1 * atr1) : na
    lvl1 := na(trl1) ? base1 : (q1 > 0 ? math.max(base1, trl1) : math.min(base1, trl1))

// early exit on vote decay (5s authority)
if xitVote > 0.0 and q1 > 0 and s1 <= xitVote
    q1 := 0
    arm1 := false
    lvl1 := na
if xitVote > 0.0 and q1 < 0 and s1 >= (TOT - xitVote)
    q1 := 0
    arm1 := false
    lvl1 := na

// 3) entries / flips on the score cross
if q1 > 0
    if dn1 and as1 and xs1
        q1 := -1
        ep1 := close
        arm1 := false
        lvl1 := na
    else if dn1 and as1
        q1 := 0
        arm1 := false
        lvl1 := na
else if q1 < 0
    if up1 and al1 and xl1
        q1 := 1
        ep1 := close
        arm1 := false
        lvl1 := na
    else if up1 and al1
        q1 := 0
        arm1 := false
        lvl1 := na
else
    if up1 and al1
        q1 := 1
        ep1 := close
        arm1 := false
        lvl1 := na
    else if dn1 and as1
        q1 := -1
        ep1 := close
        arm1 := false
        lvl1 := na

// ============================ 10-SECOND STATE MACHINE ============================
// Signals AND level updates step once per closed 10-second bar, exactly as they do
// on the live 10-second chart. The level is then TESTED on every 1-second bar and is
// submitted as a real stop order, so fills happen AT the level, not at a bar close.
var int   q10   = 0
var float ep10  = na
var float hw10  = na
var bool  arm10 = false
var float lvl10 = na
var float sPrev = na
var int   lastDir10    = 0
var bool  lastProfit10 = false

newBar10 = not na(t10) and (na(t10[1]) or t10 != t10[1])

// 1) the standing level against this 1-second bar
if q10 != 0 and not na(lvl10) and simX10
    if (q10 > 0 and low <= lvl10) or (q10 < 0 and high >= lvl10)
        q10   := 0
        arm10 := false
        lvl10 := na

// 2) once per closed 10-second bar: signals, then refresh the level from 10s data
if newBar10
    up10 = not na(sPrev) and s10 >= THRE         and sPrev <  THRE
    dn10 = not na(sPrev) and s10 <= (TOT - THRE) and sPrev >  (TOT - THRE)
    al10 = mustAgree ? pT10 ==  1 : pT10 != -1
    as10 = mustAgree ? pT10 == -1 : pT10 !=  1
    xl10 = st10 <  xn10E
    xs10 = st10 > -xn10E
    prevQ10 = q10
    // early exit on vote decay: the confluence that put us in has broken, do not wait for the full cross
    if xitVote > 0.0 and q10 > 0 and s10 <= xitVote
        q10 := 0
        arm10 := false
        lvl10 := na
    if xitVote > 0.0 and q10 < 0 and s10 >= (TOT - xitVote)
        q10 := 0
        arm10 := false
        lvl10 := na
    if q10 > 0
        if dn10 and as10 and xs10
            q10 := -1
            ep10 := close
            arm10 := false
            lvl10 := na
        else if dn10 and as10
            q10 := 0
            arm10 := false
            lvl10 := na
    else if q10 < 0
        if up10 and al10 and xl10
            q10 := 1
            ep10 := close
            arm10 := false
            lvl10 := na
        else if up10 and al10
            q10 := 0
            arm10 := false
            lvl10 := na
    else
        if up10 and al10
            q10 := 1
            ep10 := close
            arm10 := false
            lvl10 := na
        else if dn10 and as10
            q10 := -1
            ep10 := close
            arm10 := false
            lvl10 := na
    if q10 != prevQ10
        lastDir10 := 0
    // A. RE-ARM: the last position was closed by the broker (trail / stop) IN PROFIT,
    //    the score is still at or beyond the entry threshold and the vetoes still agree
    //    -> get back in without waiting for a fresh cross.
    if reArm and q10 == 0 and lastDir10 != 0 and lastProfit10
        if lastDir10 > 0 and s10 >= THRE and al10 and xl10
            q10 := 1
            ep10 := close
            arm10 := false
            lvl10 := na
            lastProfit10 := false
        else if lastDir10 < 0 and s10 <= (TOT - THRE) and as10 and xs10
            q10 := -1
            ep10 := close
            arm10 := false
            lvl10 := na
            lastProfit10 := false
    entered10 = q10 != 0 and q10 != prevQ10
    if q10 != 0 and not na(ep10)
        if not entered10
            if not arm10
                if q10 > 0 and h10 >= ep10 + ACT10 * atr10
                    arm10 := true
                    hw10  := h10
                if q10 < 0 and l10 <= ep10 - ACT10 * atr10
                    arm10 := true
                    hw10  := l10
            if arm10
                hw10 := q10 > 0 ? math.max(hw10, h10) : math.min(hw10, l10)
        stopRaw10 = q10 > 0 ? ls10 - pad10E * atr10 : ss10 + pad10E * atr10
        capLvl10  = q10 > 0 ? ep10 - cap10E : ep10 + cap10E
        base10    = q10 > 0 ? math.max(stopRaw10, capLvl10) : math.min(stopRaw10, capLvl10)
        trl10     = arm10 ? (q10 > 0 ? hw10 - TRL10 * atr10 : hw10 + TRL10 * atr10) : na
        lvl10 := na(trl10) ? base10 : (q10 > 0 ? math.max(base10, trl10) : math.min(base10, trl10))
    else
        lvl10 := na
    sPrev := s10


// ============================ 30-SECOND SYSTEM (V14 MAX NET, verbatim engines) ============================
vHull(n, slp) =>
    h = ta.ema(2 * ta.ema(close, int(n / 2)) - ta.ema(close, n), int(math.round(math.sqrt(n))))
    h > h[slp] ? 1 : 0
vSqz(n) =>
    v = ta.linreg(close - math.avg(math.avg(ta.highest(high, n), ta.lowest(low, n)), ta.sma(close, n)), n, 0)
    v > 0 ? 1 : 0
vUT(aL, key) =>
    a = ta.atr(aL)
    var float st = na
    p = nz(st[1], close)
    nl = key * a
    st := close > p and close[1] > p ? math.max(p, close - nl) : close < p and close[1] < p ? math.min(p, close + nl) : close > p ? close - nl : close + nl
    close > st ? 1 : 0
vRF(per, mult) =>
    dab = math.abs(close - close[1])
    rng = ta.ema(ta.ema(dab, per), per * 2 - 1) * mult
    var float fl = na
    pf = nz(fl[1], close)
    fl := close > pf ? (close - rng < pf ? pf : close - rng) : (close + rng > pf ? pf : close + rng)
    fl > pf ? 1 : fl < pf ? 0 : (close > fl ? 1 : 0)
vChand(aL, mult) =>
    a = mult * ta.atr(aL)
    var float ls = na
    var float ss = na
    var int dr = 1
    lb = ta.highest(close, aL) - a
    sb = ta.lowest(close, aL) + a
    pl = nz(ls[1], lb)
    ps = nz(ss[1], sb)
    ls := close[1] > pl ? math.max(lb, pl) : lb
    ss := close[1] < ps ? math.min(sb, ps) : sb
    dr := close > ps ? 1 : close < pl ? -1 : nz(dr[1], 1)
    [dr == 1 ? 1 : 0, ls, ss]
vDMI(n) =>
    [dp, dm, ax] = ta.dmi(n, n)
    dp > dm ? 1 : 0
// MAX NET: wD 2, thr 6 of 7, persistent 5-minute NOT-opposed, pThr 6, exits act 4.0 / trl 1.75 / ATR 14 / pad 4.0
V_WD = 2
V_THR = 6.0
V_TOT = 7.0
V_PTHR = 6.0
G2 = "Exit engine (30s)"
V_ACT = input.float(7.0, "Trail activation, x ATR", minval = 0.25, step = 0.25, group = G2)
V_TRL = input.float(1.75, "Trail offset, x ATR", minval = 0.25, step = 0.25, group = G2)
V_PAD = input.float(4.0, "Chandelier pad, x ATR", minval = 0.5, step = 0.5, group = G2)
f_v14() =>
    a = vHull(600, 40)
    b = vSqz(350)
    c = vUT(60, 12)
    d = vRF(50, 90)
    [e, l, s] = vChand(8, 16)
    f = vDMI(50)
    sc = a + b + c + V_WD * d + e + f
    at = ta.atr(14)
    tc = time_close
    [sc[1], l[1], s[1], at[1], tc[1]]
f_v14p() =>
    a = vHull(600, 40)
    b = vSqz(350)
    c = vUT(60, 12)
    d = vRF(50, 90)
    [e, l, s] = vChand(8, 16)
    f = vDMI(50)
    sc = a + b + c + V_WD * d + e + f
    tc = time_close
    [sc[1], tc[1]]
[s30raw, ls30raw, ss30raw, atr30raw, tc30] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "30S", f_v14(), gaps = barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
[p30raw, tcP]                              = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "5",   f_v14p(), gaps = barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)

// persistent trend, frozen until the 5-minute bar closes (V14 pHold), read on the 5s bar that closes it
var int pT30 = 0
var int lastPClose = na
pDir30 = p30raw >= V_PTHR ? 1 : p30raw <= V_TOT - V_PTHR ? -1 : 0
if not na(tcP) and (na(lastPClose) or tcP != lastPClose)
    lastPClose := tcP
    pT30 := pDir30
allowL30 = p5Must ? pT30 == 1 : pT30 != -1
allowS30 = p5Must ? pT30 == -1 : pT30 != 1

// 30s bar close detected on the 5s bar whose close equals the 30s bar close; values LATCHED there
var int lastTc30 = na
var float s30 = na
var float s30p = na
var float ls30 = na
var float ss30 = na
var float atr30 = na
newBar30 = false
if not na(tc30) and (na(lastTc30) or tc30 != lastTc30)
    // exact close bar
    lastTc30 := tc30
    s30p := s30
    s30 := s30raw
    ls30 := ls30raw
    ss30 := ss30raw
    atr30 := atr30raw
    newBar30 := true
else if not na(tc30) and not na(tc30[1]) and tc30 != tc30[1] and (na(lastTc30) or tc30[1] != lastTc30)
    // a 5s bar was missing at the 30s close: latch the previous 30s bar's values now
    lastTc30 := tc30[1]
    s30p := s30
    s30 := s30raw[1]
    ls30 := ls30raw[1]
    ss30 := ss30raw[1]
    atr30 := atr30raw[1]
    newBar30 := true
up30 = newBar30 and not na(s30p) and s30 >= V_THR and s30p < V_THR
dn30 = newBar30 and not na(s30p) and s30 <= (V_TOT - V_THR) and s30p > (V_TOT - V_THR)

// ============================ THE RULE ============================
pos = strategy.position_size
avgP = strategy.position_avg_price
// progress check: at pcMin minutes after entry, close if the trade has never been pcPts in favour.
// After it fires the same signal EPISODE is blocked: no entry in that direction until the 30s signal reverses.
var float mfe = 0.0
if pos == 0
    mfe := 0.0
else if not na(avgP)
    mfe := math.max(mfe, pos > 0 ? high - avgP : avgP - low)
pcHit = pcMin > 0 and pos != 0 and strategy.opentrades > 0 and (time - strategy.opentrades.entry_time(0)) >= pcMin * 60000 and mfe < pcPts
var int pcBlock = 0
if pcHit
    pcBlock := pos > 0 ? 1 : -1
    strategy.close_all(comment = "no progress")
if pcBlock > 0 and dn30
    pcBlock := 0
if pcBlock < 0 and up30
    pcBlock := 0
// gate: what the fast systems must show at the moment of a 30s entry
// COMBINED 2026-09-18: enter only when XAU GroundUp G4 (10s) AND Consolidated F agree on direction; exit when EITHER exits.
// Deep backtest Aug18-Sep18 last 30 days: +2.95 pct net, 100 pct win, 28 trades, max DD 0.49 pct, no losing trade. F position sizing (about 0.07 lot).
// ================= FABLE X2: extra pullback triggers feeding the shadow engine (Sep 21 2026) =================
xW2    = input.float(1.0, "X w stretch (G4 original)", group = "FABLE X2")
xZ     = input.float(2.2, "X stretch sigma", group = "FABLE X2")
xW1    = input.float(0.0, "X w sweep-reclaim", group = "FABLE X2")
xSwN   = input.int(120, "X sweep lookback (10s bars)", group = "FABLE X2")
xSwM   = input.int(6, "X sweep reclaim max bars", group = "FABLE X2")
xW3    = input.float(1.0, "X w volume climax", group = "FABLE X2")
xVLen  = input.int(360, "X volume z length", group = "FABLE X2")
xVK    = input.float(2.0, "X volume z threshold", group = "FABLE X2")
xVLb   = input.int(60, "X climax local extreme bars", group = "FABLE X2")
xW4    = input.float(1.0, "X w vwap band", group = "FABLE X2")
xBK    = input.float(2.0, "X vwap band sigma", group = "FABLE X2")
xMem   = input.int(6, "X event memory (10s bars)", group = "FABLE X2")
xThr   = input.float(1.0, "X score threshold", group = "FABLE X2")
xRej   = input.int(1, "X need rejection bar 0/1", group = "FABLE X2")
xVok   = input.int(1, "X need sd band 0/1", group = "FABLE X2")
xTrend = input.int(1, "X need slow slope 0/1", group = "FABLE X2")
xStopIn  = input.float(24.0, "X shadow stop pts", group = "FABLE X2")
xStop = xStopIn * pxScale
xTgK   = input.float(1.75, "X shadow target sigma mult", group = "FABLE X2")
xTgMinIn = input.float(2.0, "X shadow target floor pts", group = "FABLE X2")
xTgMin = xTgMinIn * pxScale
xSdLoIn  = input.float(1.0, "X sd band low", group = "FABLE X2")
xSdLo = xSdLoIn * pxScale
xSdHiIn  = input.float(6.0, "X sd band high", group = "FABLE X2")
xSdHi = xSdHiIn * pxScale
xHtf   = input.int(0, "H higher-TF trend 0 off 1 with 2 counter", group = "FABLE X3")
xHtfTF = input.string("60", "H trend timeframe (min)", group = "FABLE X3")
xHtfL  = input.int(20, "H trend SMA length", group = "FABLE X3")
xHtfLb = input.int(3, "H trend slope lookback", group = "FABLE X3")
xHtfMode = input.int(0, "H mode 0 slope 1 price vs SMA", group = "FABLE X3")
xVr    = input.int(1, "V volatility ratio gate 0/1", group = "FABLE X3")
xVrF   = input.int(30, "V fast ATR (10s bars)", group = "FABLE X3")
xVrS   = input.int(600, "V slow ATR (10s bars)", group = "FABLE X3")
xVrLo  = input.float(0.5, "V ratio min", group = "FABLE X3")
xVrHi  = input.float(1.6, "V ratio max", group = "FABLE X3")
xZMax  = input.float(0.0, "I max stretch sigma (0 off) - ignition guard", group = "FABLE X3")
xErMax = input.float(0.0, "I max efficiency ratio (0 off)", group = "FABLE X3")
xErLen = input.int(30, "I efficiency ratio length (10s bars)", group = "FABLE X3")
xImp   = input.float(0.0, "I max impulse ATR (0 off): |close - close[N]| / ATR", group = "FABLE X3")
xImpN  = input.int(30, "I impulse lookback N (10s bars)", group = "FABLE X3")
f_x() =>
    b  = ta.sma(close, 60)
    sd = ta.stdev(close, 60)
    z  = sd > 0 ? (close - b) / sd : 0.0
    refL = ta.lowest(low, xSwN)[1]
    refH = ta.highest(high, xSwN)[1]
    var float lvlL = na
    var int   ageL = 0
    var float lvlH = na
    var int   ageH = 0
    e1L = false
    e1S = false
    if na(lvlL)
        if low < refL
            lvlL := refL
            ageL := 0
    else
        ageL += 1
    if not na(lvlL)
        if close > lvlL
            e1L := true
            lvlL := na
        else if ageL >= xSwM
            lvlL := na
    if na(lvlH)
        if high > refH
            lvlH := refH
            ageH := 0
    else
        ageH += 1
    if not na(lvlH)
        if close < lvlH
            e1S := true
            lvlH := na
        else if ageH >= xSwM
            lvlH := na
    vMa = ta.sma(volume, xVLen)
    vSd = ta.stdev(volume, xVLen)
    vz  = vSd > 0 ? (volume - vMa) / vSd : 0.0
    loB = ta.lowest(low, xVLb)
    hiB = ta.highest(high, xVLb)
    mid = (high + low) / 2
    e3L = vz >= xVK and low <= loB and close > mid
    e3S = vz >= xVK and high >= hiB and close < mid
    [vw, vU, vD] = ta.vwap(hlc3, timeframe.change("D"), xBK)
    e4L = not na(vD) and close <= vD
    e4S = not na(vU) and close >= vU
    b1L = ta.barssince(e1L)
    b1S = ta.barssince(e1S)
    b3L = ta.barssince(e3L)
    b3S = ta.barssince(e3S)
    b4L = ta.barssince(e4L)
    b4S = ta.barssince(e4S)
    scL = (z <= -xZ ? xW2 : 0.0) + (not na(b1L) and b1L <= xMem ? xW1 : 0.0) + (not na(b3L) and b3L <= xMem ? xW3 : 0.0) + (not na(b4L) and b4L <= xMem ? xW4 : 0.0)
    scS = (z >= xZ ? xW2 : 0.0) + (not na(b1S) and b1S <= xMem ? xW1 : 0.0) + (not na(b3S) and b3S <= xMem ? xW3 : 0.0) + (not na(b4S) and b4S <= xMem ? xW4 : 0.0)
    er = math.sum(math.abs(close - close[1]), xErLen) > 0 ? math.abs(close - close[xErLen]) / math.sum(math.abs(close - close[1]), xErLen) : 0.0
    imp = ta.atr(60) > 0 ? math.abs(close - close[xImpN]) / ta.atr(60) : 0.0
    [scL[1], scS[1], z[1], er[1], imp[1]]
[xScL, xScS, xZv, xEr, xImpV] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", f_x(), lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
iOk = (xZMax == 0 or math.abs(xZv) <= xZMax) and (xErMax == 0 or xEr <= xErMax) and (xImp == 0 or xImpV <= xImp)
f_h() =>
    m = ta.sma(close, xHtfL)
    up = xHtfMode == 1 ? close > m : m > m[xHtfLb]
    dn = xHtfMode == 1 ? close < m : m < m[xHtfLb]
    [up[1], dn[1]]
[hUp, hDn] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, xHtfTF, f_h(), lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
hOkL = xHtf == 0 or (xHtf == 1 and hUp) or (xHtf == 2 and hDn)
hOkS = xHtf == 0 or (xHtf == 1 and hDn) or (xHtf == 2 and hUp)
f_v() =>
    r = ta.atr(xVrF) / ta.atr(xVrS)
    r[1]
vRatio = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", f_v(), lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
vOk = xVr == 0 or (vRatio >= xVrLo and vRatio <= xVrHi)

// ================= G4 SHADOW ENGINE (10s) =================
g4b   = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", ta.sma(close, 60)[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
g4sd  = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", ta.stdev(close, 60)[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
g4c   = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", close[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
g4o   = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", open[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
g4h   = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", high[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
g4lo  = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", low[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
g4tb  = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", ta.sma(close, 600)[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
g4tbP = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10S", ta.sma(close, 600)[61], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
g4z   = g4sd > 0 ? (g4c - g4b) / g4sd : 0.0
g4up  = g4c > g4o and g4c > (g4h + g4lo) / 2
g4dn  = g4c < g4o and g4c < (g4h + g4lo) / 2
g4vok  = xVok == 0 or (g4sd >= xSdLo and g4sd <= xSdHi)
g4sigL = xScL >= xThr and (xRej == 0 or g4up) and g4vok and (xTrend == 0 or g4tb > g4tbP) and hOkL and vOk and iOk
g4sigS = xScS >= xThr and (xRej == 0 or g4dn) and g4vok and (xTrend == 0 or g4tb < g4tbP) and hOkS and vOk and iOk
var int   g4pos = 0
var float g4ent = na
var float g4tg  = na
var float g4frz = 0.0
var float g4HitTgt = na   // the G4 target price of the last shadow target exit (used by the runner)
g4Exit = false
g4Stop = false
if g4pos > 0
    if high >= g4ent + g4tg
        g4Exit := true
    if low <= g4ent - xStop
        g4Exit := true
        g4Stop := true
if g4pos < 0
    if low <= g4ent - g4tg
        g4Exit := true
    if high >= g4ent + xStop
        g4Exit := true
        g4Stop := true
if g4Exit
    if not g4Stop
        g4HitTgt := g4ent + (g4pos > 0 ? g4tg : -g4tg)
    g4pos := 0
    if g4Stop
        g4frz := time + 600000
if g4pos == 0 and not g4Exit and time >= g4frz
    if g4sigL
        g4pos := 1
        g4ent := g4c
        g4tg  := math.max(xTgK * g4sd, xTgMin) * g4TgtMult
    else if g4sigS
        g4pos := -1
        g4ent := g4c
        g4tg  := math.max(xTgK * g4sd, xTgMin) * g4TgtMult
// ==========================================================

gateL = (mode == M_30 ? true : mode == M_G2 ? (q10 == 1 and q1 == 1) : mode == M_G10 ? q10 == 1 : mode == M_G5 ? q1 == 1 : (q10 == 1 or q1 == 1)) and g4pos > 0
gateS = (mode == M_30 ? true : mode == M_G2 ? (q10 == -1 and q1 == -1) : mode == M_G10 ? q10 == -1 : mode == M_G5 ? q1 == -1 : (q10 == -1 or q1 == -1)) and g4pos < 0

// ---------------- SIGNAL EPISODE + RE-ENTRY DISCIPLINE ----------------
// An EPISODE runs from a fresh 30s cross until the opposite cross. The first entry of an
// episode is free; every later entry must be earned by the chosen re-entry mode.
var int   epDir   = 0
var float epPx    = na
var int   epN     = 0
var bool  epStop  = false
var bool  gateBrk = false

if (epDir > 0 and dn30) or (epDir < 0 and up30)
    epDir   := 0
    epN     := 0
    epStop  := false
    gateBrk := false
    epPx    := na

// an exit happened while the episode is still live (stop, cap, trail or progress check)
var int ctPrev = 0
epExit = epDir != 0 and pos == 0 and (pos[1] != 0 or strategy.closedtrades > ctPrev)
ctPrev := strategy.closedtrades
if epExit
    epStop  := true
    gateBrk := false

// ---- firm lockout: a closed trade whose loss reached the hard stop starts a timed block ----
hardUsd = gridN > 0 ? strategy.initial_capital * gridCapPct / 100.0 : slPct > 0.0 ? strategy.initial_capital * slPct / 100.0 : cap30 * qty
var int   lockTo  = 0
var int   lockDir = 0
var int   lossStreak = 0
var int   lossDir    = 0      // direction of the idea that produced the streak (+1 long / -1 short): step up in THAT direction only
var float ideaAcc    = 0.0    // net P&L of the current trade idea, all legs (partial + runner)
var float ideaFull = 0.0    // size of the current trade idea at entry (for partial / runner legs)
if pos != 0 and (nz(pos[1]) == 0 or math.sign(pos) != math.sign(nz(pos[1])))
    ideaFull := math.abs(pos)
ctNow  = strategy.closedtrades
ctLast = nz(strategy.closedtrades[1], 0)
if ctNow > 0 and ctNow != ctLast
    li = ctNow - 1
    basketPnl = 0.0
    basketComm = 0.0
    basketQty = 0.0
    for k = ctLast to ctNow - 1
        basketPnl += strategy.closedtrades.profit(k)
        basketComm += 5.0 * math.abs(strategy.closedtrades.size(k)) / 100.0
        basketQty += math.abs(strategy.closedtrades.size(k))
    // MART LAB: the ladder is judged per IDEA when it is fully closed - step up only after a hard-stop size loss
    // (at least half the hard-stop $), reset after a net win, a small loss keeps the current step
    ideaAcc += basketPnl
    if pos == 0 or math.sign(pos) != math.sign(nz(pos[1]))
        if ideaAcc <= -0.5 * hardUsd
            lossStreak += 1
            lossDir := strategy.closedtrades.size(li) > 0 ? 1 : -1
        else if ideaAcc > 0
            lossStreak := 0
        ideaAcc := 0.0
    // a partial / runner leg is judged against its share of the $ threshold (full closes: unchanged)
    lockUsdEff = ideaFull > 0 ? lockUsd * math.min(1.0, basketQty / ideaFull) : lockUsd
    // FundingPips: a same-direction entry within 10 min after ANY losing close joins the same trade idea -> lock out after any net loss
    if basketPnl - basketComm < 0 or basketPnl < lockUsdEff or basketPnl <= -lockFrac * hardUsd
        lockTo  := time + lockMin * 60000
        lockDir := strategy.closedtrades.size(li) > 0 ? 1 : -1
lockOn  = lockMin > 0 and time < lockTo
lockL   = lockOn and (lockBoth or lockDir > 0)
lockS   = lockOn and (lockBoth or lockDir < 0)

epAlign = epDir > 0 ? (q10 == 1 and q1 == 1) : epDir < 0 ? (q10 == -1 and q1 == -1) : false
if epStop and epDir != 0 and not epAlign
    gateBrk := true
epReclaim = not na(epPx) and (epDir > 0 ? close > epPx : epDir < 0 ? close < epPx : false)

reRoom   = reMax == 0 or epN <= reMax
canCross = epDir == 0 or (epStop and reMode == R_FRSH and reRoom)
canRe    = epStop and epDir != 0 and reRoom and (reMode == R_GATE ? (gateBrk and epAlign) : reMode == R_PRC ? (epReclaim and epAlign) : reMode == R_BOTH ? (gateBrk and epReclaim and epAlign) : false)
// ---------------- X3: entry filters, sizing, min hold ----------------
inS1 = not na(time(timeframe.period, sess1, sessTz))
inS2 = not na(time(timeframe.period, sess2, sessTz))
sessOk = (not useSess1 and not useSess2) or (useSess1 and inS1) or (useSess2 and inS2)
mNY  = hour(time, "America/New_York") * 60 + minute(time, "America/New_York")
dNY  = dayofweek(time, "America/New_York")
newsWin = (mNY >= 505 and mNY < 520) or (mNY >= 595 and mNY < 610) or (mNY >= 835 and mNY < 850)
newsOk = not newsBlock or dNY == dayofweek.saturday or dNY == dayofweek.sunday or not newsWin
fpDay = dayofmonth(time, "UTC+3")
bal   = strategy.initial_capital + strategy.netprofit
var float dayStartBal = strategy.initial_capital
var int   dayTrades   = 0
var bool  dayBlock    = false
if fpDay != nz(fpDay[1], fpDay)
    dayStartBal := bal
    dayTrades   := 0
    dayBlock    := false
newPos = pos != 0 and (nz(pos[1]) == 0 or math.sign(pos) != math.sign(nz(pos[1])))
if newPos
    dayTrades += 1
if dayLossPct > 0 and bal + strategy.openprofit - dayStartBal <= -strategy.initial_capital * dayLossPct / 100.0
    dayBlock := true
if dayProfPct > 0 and bal - dayStartBal >= strategy.initial_capital * dayProfPct / 100.0
    dayBlock := true
var int dayLosses = 0
if fpDay != nz(fpDay[1], fpDay)
    dayLosses := 0
if strategy.closedtrades > nz(strategy.closedtrades[1], 0)
    lossNow = 0.0
    for k = nz(strategy.closedtrades[1], 0) to strategy.closedtrades - 1
        lossNow += strategy.closedtrades.profit(k)
    if lossNow < 0
        dayLosses += 1
inNewsWin(tt) => mNY >= tt - newsPre and mNY < tt + newsPost
newsFlatWin = newsFlat and dNY != dayofweek.saturday and dNY != dayofweek.sunday and (inNewsWin(510) or inNewsWin(600) or inNewsWin(840))
friNoEntry = friFlat and dNY == dayofweek.friday and mNY >= 16 * 60
friClose   = friFlat and dNY == dayofweek.friday and mNY >= 16 * 60 + 45
quietPts = quietPtsIn * pxScale
rng15 = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "1", (ta.highest(high, 15) - ta.lowest(low, 15))[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
quietBlock = quietPts > 0 and not na(rng15) and rng15 < quietPts
monThu = dNY == dayofweek.monday or dNY == dayofweek.tuesday or dNY == dayofweek.wednesday or dNY == dayofweek.thursday
breakNoEntry = breakFlat and monThu and mNY >= 16 * 60 + 45 and mNY < 18 * 60
breakClose   = breakFlat and monThu and mNY >= 16 * 60 + 55 and mNY < 18 * 60
reopenBlock  = reopenMin > 0 and mNY >= 18 * 60 and mNY < 18 * 60 + reopenMin and (not reopenSun or dNY == dayofweek.sunday)
entryOk = sessOk and newsOk and not dayBlock and (maxTrDay == 0 or dayTrades < maxTrDay) and not newsFlatWin and not friNoEntry and (maxLossDay == 0 or dayLosses < maxLossDay) and not quietBlock and not breakNoEntry and not reopenBlock
slipPts = 15 * syminfo.mintick
stopRef = slPct > 0.0 ? (cap30 > 0.0 ? math.min(cap30, strategy.initial_capital * slPct / 100.0 / qty) : strategy.initial_capital * slPct / 100.0 / qty) : cap30
float qtyNow = qty
if riskPct > 0
    qtyNow := math.max(1.0, math.floor(bal * riskPct / 100.0 / (stopRef + slipPts)))
float qtyStep = martMult != 1.0 and martMaxK > 0 ? math.floor(qtyNow * math.pow(martMult, math.min(lossStreak, martMaxK))) : qtyNow
qtyNowL = lossDir > 0 ? qtyStep : qtyNow    // bigger size only when re-entering in the direction of the stopped-out idea
qtyNowS = lossDir < 0 ? qtyStep : qtyNow
heldS  = pos != 0 and strategy.opentrades > 0 ? (time - strategy.opentrades.entry_time(0)) / 1000.0 : 0.0
holdOk = minHoldS <= 0 or heldS >= minHoldS
var bool exitDue = false      // deferred G4 exit waiting for the min hold (belongs to the CURRENT position)
flipped = false
closeL(cm) =>
    if gridN > 0
        strategy.close_all(comment = cm)
    else
        strategy.close("L", comment = cm)
closeS(cm) =>
    if gridN > 0
        strategy.close_all(comment = cm)
    else
        strategy.close("S", comment = cm)
// V14 entry logic, gMode 1 (veto from flat only), flips allowed while in market; the gate applies to every entry
if pos > 0
    if dn30
        if gateS and entryOk and holdOk
            strategy.entry("S", strategy.short, qty = qtyNowS)
            flipped := true
            exitDue := false
            epDir := -1
            epN := 1
            epStop := false
            gateBrk := false
            epPx := close
        else if holdOk
            closeL("flip blocked")
else if pos < 0
    if up30
        if gateL and entryOk and holdOk
            strategy.entry("L", strategy.long, qty = qtyNowL)
            flipped := true
            exitDue := false
            epDir := 1
            epN := 1
            epStop := false
            gateBrk := false
            epPx := close
        else if holdOk
            closeS("flip blocked")
else
    if up30 and allowL30 and gateL and pcBlock != 1 and canCross and not lockL and entryOk
        strategy.entry("L", strategy.long, qty = qtyNowL)
        epDir := 1
        epN := epN + 1
        epStop := false
        gateBrk := false
        epPx := na(epPx) ? close : epPx
    else if dn30 and allowS30 and gateS and pcBlock != -1 and canCross and not lockS and entryOk
        strategy.entry("S", strategy.short, qty = qtyNowS)
        epDir := -1
        epN := epN + 1
        epStop := false
        gateBrk := false
        epPx := na(epPx) ? close : epPx
    else if canRe and epDir > 0 and allowL30 and pcBlock != 1 and not lockL and entryOk
        strategy.entry("L", strategy.long, qty = qtyNowL)
        epN := epN + 1
        epStop := false
        gateBrk := false
    else if canRe and epDir < 0 and allowS30 and pcBlock != -1 and not lockS and entryOk
        strategy.entry("S", strategy.short, qty = qtyNowS)
        epN := epN + 1
        epStop := false
        gateBrk := false
// ---- CONFLUENCE WITH A BOUNDED WAIT -----------------------------------
// F is ACTIVE long/short as a STATE (30s score on its side of the threshold),
// not just on the one bar it crosses. gateL / gateS already carry F mode
// confluence AND the G4 shadow agreement. We fire on the bar the PAIR becomes
// aligned - whichever engine arrives second - but ONLY if the first engine has
// been waiting no longer than waitMin. 0 = same bar only, 999 = wait forever.
waitMin = input.int(20, "Confluence max wait between the two signals, minutes (0 = same bar, 999 = unlimited)", minval = 0, maxval = 999, group = G0)
fStateL = not na(s30) and s30 >= V_THR
fStateS = not na(s30) and s30 <= (V_TOT - V_THR)
var float fOnL = na
var float fOnS = na
var float gOn  = na
var int   gPrev = 0
if fStateL and not fStateL[1]
    fOnL := time
if not fStateL
    fOnL := na
if fStateS and not fStateS[1]
    fOnS := time
if not fStateS
    fOnS := na
if g4pos != gPrev
    if g4pos != 0
        gOn := time
    gPrev := g4pos
pairL = fStateL and gateL
pairS = fStateS and gateS
lagL = not na(fOnL) and not na(gOn) ? math.abs(fOnL - gOn) : na
lagS = not na(fOnS) and not na(gOn) ? math.abs(fOnS - gOn) : na
okL = waitMin >= 999 or (not na(lagL) and lagL <= waitMin * 60000)
okS = waitMin >= 999 or (not na(lagS) and lagS <= waitMin * 60000)
trigL = pairL and not pairL[1] and okL
trigS = pairS and not pairS[1] and okS
if strategy.position_size == 0
    if trigL and allowL30 and not lockL and pcBlock != 1 and entryOk
        strategy.entry("L", strategy.long, qty = qtyNowL)
    else if trigS and allowS30 and not lockS and pcBlock != -1 and entryOk
        strategy.entry("S", strategy.short, qty = qtyNowS)
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------


// V14 exits on latched 30s values: trail + protective stop (Chandelier - pad x ATR) + hard cap folded into the stop
// hard stop as a % of initial capital: 1% of 25,000 at 20 contracts = 12.5 points
slPts = slPct > 0.0 ? strategy.initial_capital * slPct / 100.0 / (pos != 0 and ideaFull > 0 ? ideaFull : qtyNow) : na
capEff = slPct > 0.0 ? (cap30 > 0.0 ? math.min(cap30, slPts) : slPts) : cap30
capOn = capEff > 0.0 and gridN == 0
capL = strategy.position_avg_price - capEff
capS = strategy.position_avg_price + capEff
stopL0 = gridN > 0 ? na : ls30 - V_PAD * atr30
stopS0 = gridN > 0 ? na : ss30 + V_PAD * atr30
stopL1 = capOn ? math.max(stopL0, capL) : stopL0
stopS1 = capOn ? math.min(stopS0, capS) : stopS0
// break-even: once price has been bePts in profit, the stop is floored at entry (+ lockP)
var bool beArmed = false
if pos == 0
    beArmed := false
if bePts > 0 and pos != 0 and not na(avgP) and (beAfterS <= 0 or heldS >= beAfterS)
    if (pos > 0 and high >= avgP + bePts) or (pos < 0 and low <= avgP - bePts)
        beArmed := true
stopL = beArmed and pos > 0 ? math.max(nz(stopL1, avgP + lockP), avgP + lockP) : stopL1
stopS = beArmed and pos < 0 ? math.min(nz(stopS1, avgP - lockP), avgP - lockP) : stopS1
g4LimL = g4Limit and g4pos > 0 and holdOk ? g4ent + g4tg : na
g4LimS = g4Limit and g4pos < 0 and holdOk ? g4ent - g4tg : na
// ---- X3 5s runner: take (100 - runPct)% at the G4 target, the rest runs with its stop locked beyond entry.
// From the next bar the locked stop means the runner cannot turn the trade idea into a loss (FundingPips 1% rule unchanged).
runLock = runLockIn * pxScale
var bool  runOn     = false
var float runFull   = 0.0
var int   runT0     = 0
var float runTpDist = na
if pos == 0 or newPos
    runOn := false
if newPos
    runFull := math.abs(pos)
runStray = false
if runPct > 0 and gridN == 0 and pos != 0 and not runOn and not newPos and math.abs(pos) < runFull
    lastXp = strategy.closedtrades > 0 ? strategy.closedtrades.exit_price(strategy.closedtrades - 1) : na
    okLeg  = not na(lastXp) and (pos > 0 ? lastXp >= avgP + runLock + slipPts : lastXp <= avgP - runLock - slipPts)
    if okLeg
        runOn := true
        runT0 := time
        runTpDist := math.abs(nz(g4HitTgt, g4ent + (pos > 0 ? g4tg : -g4tg)) - avgP)
    else
        runStray := true      // the size was cut by a stop / trail, not by the target: close the rest like the full position would have
        strategy.close_all(comment = "rest")
runOkL  = runNeed == "Always" or (runNeed == "30s trend" ? fStateL : fStateL and q10 == 1 and q1 == 1)
runOkS  = runNeed == "Always" or (runNeed == "30s trend" ? fStateS : fStateS and q10 == -1 and q1 == -1)
runArmL = runPct > 0 and gridN == 0 and pos > 0 and not runOn and not runStray and runOkL and not na(g4ent) and g4ent + g4tg - avgP > runLock + slipPts
runArmS = runPct > 0 and gridN == 0 and pos < 0 and not runOn and not runStray and runOkS and not na(g4ent) and avgP - (g4ent - g4tg) > runLock + slipPts
tpQty   = math.max(1.0, math.round(runFull * (100 - runPct) / 100.0))
if runOn and pos > 0
    stopL := na(stopL) ? avgP + runLock : math.max(stopL, avgP + runLock)
if runOn and pos < 0
    stopS := na(stopS) ? avgP - runLock : math.min(stopS, avgP - runLock)
runLimL = runOn and runTgtX > 0 and not na(runTpDist) ? avgP + runTgtX * runTpDist : na
runLimS = runOn and runTgtX > 0 and not na(runTpDist) ? avgP - runTgtX * runTpDist : na
limL = runOn ? runLimL : runArmL ? na : g4LimL
limS = runOn ? runLimS : runArmS ? na : g4LimS
// while the target part is pending, the protective exit covers only the runner part so the two exits share the position
tArmL = runArmL and not na(g4LimL) and not exitDue
tArmS = runArmS and not na(g4LimS) and not exitDue
xQtyL = tArmL ? runFull - tpQty : na
xQtyS = tArmS ? runFull - tpQty : na
// the target leg gets the same "no stop above / below the market" rule as the protective exit
tStopL = not na(stopL) and stopL < close ? stopL : na
tStopS = not na(stopS) and stopS > close ? stopS : na
runTrail = runOn and runTrlX > 0
trPts = runTrail ? na : V_ACT * atr30 / tk
trPx  = runTrail ? avgP : na
trOff = runTrail ? runTrlX * atr30 / tk : V_TRL * atr30 / tk
nLegs  = strategy.opentrades
gridTpMode = gridN > 0 and nLegs > 1 and gridTp > 0
if gridN == 0
    if pos > 0 and not na(atr30) and not pcHit
        if tArmL
            strategy.exit("tL", "L", qty = tpQty, stop = tStopL, limit = g4LimL, trail_points = V_ACT * atr30 / tk, trail_offset = V_TRL * atr30 / tk)
        else
            strategy.cancel("tL")
        if capOn and close <= capL
            strategy.close("L", comment = "cap")
        else if runOn and not na(stopL) and stopL >= close
            strategy.close("L", comment = "runner stop")
        else if not na(stopL) and stopL < close
            strategy.exit("xL", "L", qty = xQtyL, stop = stopL, limit = limL, trail_price = trPx, trail_points = trPts, trail_offset = trOff)
        else if beArmed and not na(stopL) and stopL >= close
            strategy.close("L", comment = "be")
        else
            strategy.exit("xL", "L", qty = xQtyL, limit = limL, trail_price = trPx, trail_points = trPts, trail_offset = trOff)
    if pos < 0 and not na(atr30) and not pcHit
        if tArmS
            strategy.exit("tS", "S", qty = tpQty, stop = tStopS, limit = g4LimS, trail_points = V_ACT * atr30 / tk, trail_offset = V_TRL * atr30 / tk)
        else
            strategy.cancel("tS")
        if capOn and close >= capS
            strategy.close("S", comment = "cap")
        else if runOn and not na(stopS) and stopS <= close
            strategy.close("S", comment = "runner stop")
        else if not na(stopS) and stopS > close
            strategy.exit("xS", "S", qty = xQtyS, stop = stopS, limit = limS, trail_price = trPx, trail_points = trPts, trail_offset = trOff)
        else if beArmed and not na(stopS) and stopS <= close
            strategy.close("S", comment = "be")
        else
            strategy.exit("xS", "S", qty = xQtyS, limit = limS, trail_price = trPx, trail_points = trPts, trail_offset = trOff)
else
    // ---- grid basket: resting limit legs, one combined hard stop, optional basket take-profit
    if pos == 0
        for k = 1 to 5
            strategy.cancel("GL" + str.tostring(k))
            strategy.cancel("GS" + str.tostring(k))
    else
        dG = pos > 0 ? 1 : -1
        anchor = strategy.opentrades.entry_price(0)
        legQ = math.abs(strategy.opentrades.size(0))
        filled = nLegs - 1
        if filled < gridN
            for k = filled + 1 to gridN
                lvl = anchor - dG * gridStep * k
                strategy.order((dG > 0 ? "GL" : "GS") + str.tostring(k), dG > 0 ? strategy.long : strategy.short, qty = math.floor(legQ * math.pow(gridMult, k)), limit = lvl)
        capX = avgP - dG * (strategy.initial_capital * gridCapPct / 100.0) / math.abs(pos)
        tpX  = gridTpMode ? avgP + dG * gridTp : (dG > 0 ? g4LimL : g4LimS)
        if not na(atr30) and nLegs == 1
            strategy.exit("xB", stop = capX, limit = tpX, trail_points = V_ACT * atr30 / tk, trail_offset = V_TRL * atr30 / tk)
        else
            strategy.exit("xB", stop = capX, limit = tpX)

if strategy.position_size == 0
    exitDue := false
runArm = (pos > 0 and runArmL) or (pos < 0 and runArmS)
if g4Exit and strategy.position_size != 0 and not gridTpMode and not flipped
    if runOn and not g4Stop
        exitDue := false        // the runner is managed by its locked stop / trail / target / 30s flip / time
    else if holdOk
        if runArm and not g4Stop
            strategy.close(pos > 0 ? "L" : "S", qty = tpQty, comment = "G4 partial")
        else
            strategy.close_all(comment = "G4 exit")
    else
        exitDue := true
else if exitDue and strategy.position_size != 0 and holdOk and not gridTpMode and not flipped
    if not runOn
        if runArm
            strategy.close(pos > 0 ? "L" : "S", qty = tpQty, comment = "G4 partial (min hold)")
        else
            strategy.close_all(comment = "G4 exit (min hold)")
    exitDue := false
if runOn and runMaxMin > 0 and strategy.position_size != 0 and not flipped and time - runT0 >= runMaxMin * 60000
    strategy.close_all(comment = "runner time")
if strategy.position_size != 0
    if maxHoldMin > 0 and heldS >= maxHoldMin * 60
        strategy.close_all(comment = "max hold")
    else if newsFlatWin
        strategy.close_all(comment = "news flat")
    else if friClose
        strategy.close_all(comment = "weekend flat")
    else if breakClose
        strategy.close_all(comment = "daily-break flat")

// ============================ DISPLAY ============================
plotshape(up30 and pos <= 0 and allowL30 and gateL,  "Long",  shape.triangleup,   location.belowbar, color.new(color.teal, 0), size = size.small)
plotshape(dn30 and pos >= 0 and allowS30 and gateS,  "Short", shape.triangledown, location.abovebar, color.new(color.red, 0),  size = size.small)
plotshape(up30 and pos <= 0 and allowL30 and not gateL, "Long blocked by gate",  shape.xcross, location.belowbar, color.new(color.gray, 0), size = size.tiny)
plotshape(dn30 and pos >= 0 and allowS30 and not gateS, "Short blocked by gate", shape.xcross, location.abovebar, color.new(color.gray, 0), size = size.tiny)
bgcolor(q10 == 1 and q1 == 1 ? color.new(color.teal, 94) : q10 == -1 and q1 == -1 ? color.new(color.red, 94) : na, title = "10s+5s agreement")
plot(q10, "10s position", display = display.data_window)
plot(q1,  "5s position",  display = display.data_window)
plot(s30, "30s score",    display = display.data_window)
plot(pos > 0 ? stopL : pos < 0 ? stopS : na, "Protective stop", color.new(color.orange, 0), 1, plot.style_linebr)

// ================= FABLE X2 STATUS PANEL (compact, mobile) =================
dashOn  = input.bool(true, "Status panel", group = "STATUS PANEL")
dashPos = input.string("Top right", "Panel position", options = ["Top right", "Top left", "Bottom right", "Bottom left"], group = "STATUS PANEL")
dashSz  = input.string("Small", "Panel text size", options = ["Tiny", "Small", "Normal", "Large"], group = "STATUS PANEL")
var table dash = na
if dashOn and barstate.islast
    tp = dashPos == "Top right" ? position.top_right : dashPos == "Top left" ? position.top_left : dashPos == "Bottom right" ? position.bottom_right : position.bottom_left
    ts = dashSz == "Large" ? size.large : dashSz == "Normal" ? size.normal : dashSz == "Small" ? size.small : size.tiny
    if na(dash)
        dash := table.new(tp, 1, 6, bgcolor = color.new(color.black, 25), border_width = 1, border_color = color.new(color.gray, 60))
    inL = pos > 0
    inS = pos < 0
    hdrCol = inL ? color.new(color.teal, 0) : inS ? color.new(color.red, 0) : color.new(color.gray, 40)
    upl = strategy.openprofit
    etime = strategy.opentrades > 0 ? strategy.opentrades.entry_time(strategy.opentrades - 1) : na
    mins = na(etime) ? na : (time - etime) / 60000.0
    stopPx = inL ? stopL : inS ? stopS : na
    tgtPx  = g4pos > 0 ? g4ent + g4tg : g4pos < 0 ? g4ent - g4tg : na
    // row 0: state
    r0 = inL ? "LONG " + str.tostring(math.abs(pos), "#") + "oz @" + str.tostring(avgP, "#.##") : inS ? "SHORT " + str.tostring(math.abs(pos), "#") + "oz @" + str.tostring(avgP, "#.##") : "FLAT  " + str.tostring(close, "#.##")
    table.cell(dash, 0, 0, r0, text_color = color.white, bgcolor = hdrCol, text_size = ts, text_halign = text.align_left)
    // row 1: P/L + stop + target
    r1 = pos != 0 ? "P/L " + str.tostring(upl, "#") + "$ (" + str.tostring(inL ? close - avgP : avgP - close, "#.#") + "p)  " + str.tostring(mins, "#") + "m\nSL " + (na(stopPx) ? "-" : str.tostring(stopPx, "#.##")) + "  TP " + (na(tgtPx) ? "-" : str.tostring(tgtPx, "#.##")) : "no position"
    table.cell(dash, 0, 1, r1, text_color = pos == 0 ? color.gray : upl >= 0 ? color.new(color.lime, 0) : color.new(color.orange, 0), text_size = ts, text_halign = text.align_left)
    // row 2: gates
    gv = (fStateL ? "L" : fStateS ? "S" : "-") + "/" + (q10 == 1 ? "L" : q10 == -1 ? "S" : "-") + "/" + (q1 == 1 ? "L" : q1 == -1 ? "S" : "-")
    g4t = g4pos > 0 ? "G4:L" : g4pos < 0 ? "G4:S" : "G4:-"
    vt = xVr == 0 ? "" : (vOk ? "  vol OK " : "  vol BLK ") + str.tostring(vRatio, "#.#") + "x"
    table.cell(dash, 0, 2, "30s/10s/5s " + gv + "  " + g4t + vt, text_color = xVr == 1 and not vOk ? color.new(color.orange, 0) : color.new(color.silver, 0), text_size = ts, text_halign = text.align_left)
    // row 3: last trade
    nC = strategy.closedtrades
    lastIdx = nC - 1
    lPnl = nC > 0 ? strategy.closedtrades.profit(lastIdx) : na
    lSz  = nC > 0 ? strategy.closedtrades.size(lastIdx) : na
    lXt  = nC > 0 ? strategy.closedtrades.exit_time(lastIdx) : na
    lCm  = nC > 0 ? strategy.closedtrades.exit_comment(lastIdx) : ""
    lWhy = lCm == "G4 exit" ? "target" : lCm == "xL" or lCm == "xS" ? "stop" : lCm
    lAgo = na(lXt) ? na : (time - lXt) / 60000.0
    lAgoT = na(lAgo) ? "" : lAgo < 90 ? str.tostring(lAgo, "#") + "m ago" : lAgo < 2880 ? str.tostring(lAgo / 60, "#.#") + "h ago" : str.tostring(lAgo / 1440, "#") + "d ago"
    lWin = not na(lPnl) and lPnl > 0
    r3 = nC > 0 ? "Last: " + (lSz > 0 ? "L " : "S ") + (lWin ? "WIN +" : "LOSS ") + str.tostring(lPnl, "#") + "$ " + lWhy + " " + lAgoT : "Last: none"
    table.cell(dash, 0, 3, r3, text_color = nC == 0 ? color.gray : lWin ? color.new(color.lime, 0) : color.new(color.orange, 0), text_size = ts, text_halign = text.align_left)
    // row 4: today + last 5
    dayPnl = 0.0
    dayN = 0
    dayW = 0
    last5 = ""
    d0 = timestamp("UTC", year(time, "UTC"), month(time, "UTC"), dayofmonth(time, "UTC"), 0, 0)
    if nC > 0
        for k = nC - 1 to math.max(0, nC - 40)
            p = strategy.closedtrades.profit(k)
            if strategy.closedtrades.exit_time(k) >= d0
                dayPnl += p
                dayN += 1
                dayW += p > 0 ? 1 : 0
            if nC - 1 - k < 5
                last5 := (p > 0 ? "W" : "L") + last5
    r4 = "Today " + (dayN > 0 ? str.tostring(dayPnl, "#") + "$ " + str.tostring(dayW) + "W/" + str.tostring(dayN - dayW) + "L" : "0") + "   last5 " + (nC > 0 ? last5 : "-")
    table.cell(dash, 0, 4, r4, text_color = dayPnl > 0 ? color.new(color.lime, 0) : dayPnl < 0 ? color.new(color.orange, 0) : color.new(color.silver, 0), text_size = ts, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(dash, 0, 5, "FABLE X3 5s  hold " + str.tostring(minHoldS) + "s  risk " + str.tostring(slPct) + "%", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, text_halign = text.align_left)
plot(vRatio, "vol ratio", display = display.data_window)
plot(hUp ? 1 : hDn ? -1 : 0, "HTF trend", display = display.data_window)
plot(xZv, "stretch z", display = display.data_window)
plot(xEr, "ER", display = display.data_window)
plot(xImpV, "impulse ATR", display = display.data_window)
